    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT clears integral, previous input, and output.</li>
      <li>OUTPUT emits the stored controller output. UPDATE computes P, I, and D terms from input and dt.</li>
      <li>The result is clamped between min and max.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y = \operatorname{clamp}\left(k_p u + k_i\int u\,dt + k_d\frac{du}{dt},\,min,\,max\right)</latex>
